        // v381 summary:
        // - "Скруглять стыки" is now a hard renderer gate. OFF means no Spiral period/
        //   closing fillet can be generated by vertex rounding, Tangentiality or Morph.
        // - Segment-profile rounding is no longer baked before nonlinear Spiral mapping.
        //   Authored profile corners are rounded in final Spiral coordinates with the same
