        //   the seam.
        // - Removes the latent Morph rule `tangential || spiralRoundSeams`: Tangentiality
        //   can no longer silently enable seam rounding.
        // v380 summary:
        // - Fixes Continuous Spiral seam detection. Coincident previous-end/current-start
        //   points are no longer mistaken for a zero-angle tangent.
        // - The detector skips the duplicate seam coordinate and uses the nearest distinct
        //   point from the previous copy plus the nearest distinct point in the current copy.
        // - Therefore a position-continuous but direction-discontinuous seam is rounded by
        //   the same ordinary period-seam fillet used everywhere else.
        // - A genuinely C1 Tangential seam remains untouched because its real neighbouring
