        // - Only actual turns above a small angle threshold are rounded. A naturally C1
        //   continuous tangential seam is left untouched instead of being artificially bent.
        // - Static and Morph Spiral call the same auto-close/rounding helper; closure fillets
        //   are protected from the 100–200% secondary smoothing stage.
        // v377 summary:
        // - "Режим контура" now has four explicit choices in one row:
